Dear Tom,

We are opening the 2027 rate round. Attached you will find our offer for all =
19 ocean lanes you currently have with us. Due to higher vessel operating cos=
ts and port surcharges, we are proposing an increase of +6% on every lane, ef=
fective 1 January 2027.

The offer is valid until 30 November 2026. To secure allocations for Q1, we w=
ould appreciate your answer by 18 November.

Happy to walk you through the calculation in a call this week or next. Just l=
et me know what suits you.

Best regards, Pia

